<tr><td>CS.2 part 2</td><td>13–24</td><td>run ◇/◆ on PostgreSQL; map dependency, generalization (3 inheritance strategies), realization, many-to-many with attributes and qualifiers; write a Flyway migration; reverse-engineer a diagram; fix the usual Report 4 mistakes</td></tr>
