<tr><td>1.1 System Architecture</td><td>"the overall diagram which includes the sub-systems, the external systems, and the relationship/connection among them" + an explanation of every box</td><td><a href="/courses/software-architecture-and-design/learn?lessonSlug=swd392-slide-swd16-1">3.B</a>, ⭐ CS.1</td></tr>
