<tr><td>3. Detailed Design → 3.1 &lt;Feature/Function Name1&gt;</td><td>3.1.1 Class Diagram · 3.1.2 &lt;Sequence Diagram Name1&gt; · 3.1.3 …</td><td><a href="/courses/software-architecture-and-design/learn?lessonSlug=swd392-slide-swd11-1">2.N–2.O</a>, ⭐ CS.3</td></tr>
