<div class="anh-slide uml"><img src="https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SWD392/uml/ab45ba1b17120538c4c61ec666638dee1e186a3e.svg" alt="Report 4 §1.1 System Architecture — LabFlow AI" loading="lazy" /><p class="chu-thich">🧩 Report 4 §1.1 System Architecture — LabFlow AI</p></div>
